strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-calendar w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","rect","1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"30 July 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If your kitchen tap is dripping, stiff to operate or showing signs of corrosion, replacement can be more practical than repeated repairs. But how much does it cost to replace a kitchen tap in the UK? As a rough guide, many straightforward replacements typically come to around £120–£350, including a mid-range tap and labour. The final price depends on the tap you choose, how accessible the plumbing is and whether the existing fittings can be removed without damage. Every project differs, so request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Typical kitchen tap replacement costs in the UK"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["As a rough guide, a basic kitchen tap may cost approximately £30–£80, while a mid-range mixer tap may fall around £80–£200. Designer, filtered, boiling-water and pull-out spray taps can cost considerably more, sometimes £250–£600 or above. These are broad typical UK guide prices rather than fixed rates, as brands, finishes, features and individual project requirements make a substantial difference."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Basic replacement tap: roughly £30–£80"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Standard mixer tap: roughly £80–£200"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Premium or specialist tap: approximately £250–£600 or more"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Labour for a straightforward replacement: often around £80–£180"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Likely total for a standard replacement: approximately £120–£350, excluding unexpected plumbing work"]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What does the labour charge include?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For a simple like-for-like replacement, labour may cover isolating the water supply, disconnecting the old tap, fitting the new tap, reconnecting the flexible hoses and checking for leaks. The time required varies with access, the condition of the isolation valves and the type of connections. A minimum call-out charge may apply, particularly when the job is booked as a standalone visit."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"When can the installation cost more?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The quoted labour can increase if the old tap has seized onto the pipework, the isolation valves no longer close fully or the connections are corroded. A tap fitted tightly against a wall or inside a crowded cupboard can also take longer to remove and install. If the new tap has different connection requirements, an adapter, replacement hose or altered pipework may be needed."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Seized nuts or corroded fittings that need careful removal"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Faulty or inaccessible isolation valves"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Leaking or damaged flexible tap connectors"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Pipework that needs adapting to suit the new tap"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A sink or worktop that needs cleaning, resealing or minor repair around the tap hole"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Limited access beneath the sink, especially where drawers, waste bins or appliances obstruct the connections"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Other costs to consider before buying a tap"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The tap is only one part of the replacement cost. Check whether the product includes flexible connectors, fixing hardware and any required filters. Some taps use non-standard hose sizes or need a separate mounting plate. Specialist products may also require a power supply, filter system or additional pipework, which should be assessed before installation rather than discovered during the fitting."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["It is also worth checking the number and position of holes in the sink or worktop. A monobloc mixer commonly uses one suitable hole, whereas some older kitchens have separate hot and cold taps. Replacing a two-hole arrangement with a single-hole mixer may involve fitting a cover plate or modifying the sink, depending on the design. Conversely, creating a new hole in a worktop or sink is not always suitable and should be assessed carefully."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to keep kitchen tap replacement affordable"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The simplest way to control the budget is to choose a reliable like-for-like replacement and avoid changing the sink or worktop at the same time. If the existing plumbing is in good condition, a standard mixer tap may require less time and fewer additional parts than a specialist model. However, the lowest-priced tap may not always offer the best long-term value if replacement parts are difficult to obtain or the tap does not suit the installation."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Measure the existing tap holes and check the connector sizes before ordering."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Take a clear photograph of the plumbing beneath the sink so the installer can assess access and fittings."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Choose a tap with suitable flexible hoses and compatible connections where possible."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Ask whether the quote includes removal and disposal of the old tap, materials and VAT if applicable."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Arrange other minor plumbing or kitchen tasks during the same visit if this avoids a second call-out."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Do not ignore a small leak beneath the sink, as water damage to cabinets and flooring can make a simple replacement more expensive."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Should you replace the tap yourself?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Replacing a kitchen tap can be a manageable DIY job if the isolation valves are accessible, the connections are sound and you have the correct tools. The main risks are damaging old fittings, failing to create a watertight seal or discovering that the water cannot be isolated properly. Turn off the supply before disconnecting anything, protect the cupboard from residual water and test every joint carefully after installation."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If the valves are stuck, the pipework is corroded or you cannot identify how to isolate the supply, using a professional may be the safer option. A local renovation team may also be useful when the tap replacement forms part of a wider kitchen update. BMB Renovation carries out kitchen fitting and renovation work, with plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation handled in-house. The company is based at 157 Judge Street, Watford WD24 5AN, and works across Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead, Borehamwood, Harrow, Croxley Green, Luton and Bedford. You can review ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-fitting-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen fitting in Watford"}]," or request a ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"free, no-obligation quote"}],"."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Getting an accurate replacement price"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For a useful quote, provide the tap model or a link to the product, photographs of the sink and the plumbing beneath it, and details of any current leak or difficulty turning off the water. Mention whether the new tap is a standard mixer, pull-out spray, filtered or boiling-water model. This can help the installer identify likely connection issues and provide a clearer price before attending."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["In summary, as a rough UK guide, a straightforward kitchen tap replacement may cost around £120–£350, but a premium tap or difficult plumbing can take the total higher. Treat these figures as a starting point: the condition of the existing fittings, local labour rates and the exact product will determine the final cost. Every project differs, so obtain a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get My Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-help w-6 h-6 text-[#C8A97E]","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"