 call-out charges, local rates and the condition of the existing fittings affect the price. Obtain a free, no-obligation quote for an accurate project-specific cost."]}]]}],["$","details","2",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Can I replace a kitchen tap without replacing the sink?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[#C8A97E] text-xl leading-none group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform flex-shrink-0","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-5 text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-50 pt-4","children":["Usually, yes. The new tap must suit the existing hole pattern, sink thickness and plumbing connections. An adapter or cover plate may be needed if the arrangements differ."]}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Why is my kitchen tap replacement quote higher than expected?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[#C8A97E] text-xl leading-none group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform flex-shrink-0","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-5 text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-50 pt-4","children":["Possible reasons include seized fittings, corroded pipework, faulty isolation valves, poor access beneath the sink or the need for adapters and replacement connectors."]}]]}],["$","details","4",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className